<title>POLAND: Stalexport Q1 net falls to PLN 7.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Stalexport Q1 net falls to PLN 7.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stalexport preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			  na  vs	na</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  12.36 vs     17.53</p>
<p>    net profit				 7.64 vs	9.79</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Stalexport SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				573.12 vs    394.30</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 532.88 vs    381.96</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		    na  vs	na</p>
<p>    income tax				 4.73 vs	6.26</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	1.48</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    14.73 vs     18.65</p>
<p>    financial costs			 22.46 vs     17.51</p>
<p>    investment				14.44 vs     18.77</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
